es we have always used: location, the property itself, and tenant or covenant strength.</p></div><div class="transition-all duration-[900ms] ease-[cubic-bezier(0.22,0.61,0.36,1)] will-change-transform translate-y-0 opacity-100" style="transition-delay: 120ms;"><ul class="mt-8 max-w-md space-y-3.5"><li class="flex gap-3.5"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-0.5 flex h-5.5 w-5.5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-gold/40 bg-gold/10 text-gold-deep"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.25" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check h-3 w-3" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></span><span class="text-[0.95rem] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">Joint venture opportunities on current and upcoming projects</span></li><li class="flex gap-3.5"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-0.5 flex h-5.5 w-5.5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-gold/40 bg-gold/10 text-gold-deep"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.25" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check h-3 w-3" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></span><span class="text-[0.95rem] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">Commercial units and commercial-to-residential refurbishments</span></li><li class="flex gap-3.5"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-0.5 flex h-5.5 w-5.5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-gold/40 bg-gold/10 text-gold-deep"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.25" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check h-3 w-3" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></span><span class="text-[0.95rem] leading-relaxed