div></div></div></div></section><section id="property-owners" aria-labelledby="property-owners-heading" class="relative bg-cream"><div class="relative mx-auto max-w-[88rem] px-5 py-24 sm:px-8 lg:px-12 lg:py-32"><div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-14"><div class="lg:col-span-6"><div class="transition-all duration-[900ms] ease-[cubic-bezier(0.22,0.61,0.36,1)] will-change-transform translate-y-0 opacity-100" style="transition-delay: 0ms;"><p class="eyebrow flex items-center gap-3 text-gold-deep"><span aria-hidden="true" class="font-display text-[0.95rem] leading-none font-medium tracking-normal">03</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px w-10 bg-gold"></span>For Property Owners</p><h2 id="property-owners-heading" class="mt-5 max-w-xl font-display text-[2.6rem] leading-[1.04] font-medium sm:text-[3.4rem] text-navy">A direct, considered <em class="font-normal not-italic text-gold-deep">route to selling</em></h2><p class="mt-6 max-w-md text-[1rem] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">If you own a house, flat, HMO or commercial property in Birmingham or the West Midlands, we may be able to buy directly from you — including properties that need work. No viewings treadmill, no chain, and no estate-agent fees when you sell to us. We will explain exactly what is possible, and what is not, before you commit to anything.</p></div><div class="transition-all duration-[900ms] ease-[cubic-bezier(0.22,0.61,0.36,1)] will-change-transform translate-y-0 opacity-100" style="transition-delay: 120ms;"><ul class="mt-8 max-w-md space-y-3.5"><li class="flex gap-3.5"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-0.5 flex h-5.5 w-5.5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-gold/40 bg-gold/10 text-gold-deep"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.25" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check h-3 w-3" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></span><span class="text-[0.95rem] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">Houses, flats, HMOs and commercial property all considered</span></li><li class="flex gap-3.5"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-0.5 flex h-5.5 w-5.5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-gold/40 bg-gold/10 text-gold-deep"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.25" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check h-3 w-3" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></span><span class="text-[0.95rem] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">Properties needing refurbishment — we buy to renovate and develop</span></li><li class="flex gap-3.5"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-0.5 flex h-5.5 w-5.5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-gold/40 bg-gold/10 text-gold-deep"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.25" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check h-3 w-3" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></span><span class="text-[0.95rem] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">Buy directly from you, cutting out middlemen and agent fees</span></li><li class="flex gap-3.5"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-0.5 flex h-5.5 w-5.5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-gold/40 bg-gold/10 text-gold-deep"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.25" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check h-3 w-3" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></span><span class="text-[0.95rem] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">Time-sensitive circumstances discussed openly, with clear next steps</span></li></ul></div><div class="transition-all duration-[900ms] ease-[cubic-bezier(0.22,0.61,0.36,1)] will-change-transform translate-y-0 opacity-100" style="transition-delay: 200ms;"><div class="mt-10 flex flex-col gap-3.5 sm:flex-row"><a href="#enquire" class="group/btn inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2.5 rounded-[2px] px-7 py-3.5 text-[0.8125rem] font-semibold tracking-[0.12em] uppercase transition-all duration-300 ease-out bg-navy text-cream hover:bg-navy-soft shadow-[0_10px_28px_-12px_rgba(23,43,58,0.55)]"><span>Explore My Selling Options</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 transition-transform duration-300 group-hover/btn:translate-x-1" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a><a href="#enquire" class="group/btn inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2.5 rounded-[2px] px-7 py-3.5 text-[0.8125rem] font-semibold tracking-[0.12em] uppercase transition-all duration-300 ease-out border border-navy/30 text-navy hover:border-navy hover:bg-navy hover:text-cream"><span>Request a Property Discussion</span></a></div></div></div><div class="lg:col-span-6"><div class="transition-all duration-[900ms] ease-[cubic-bezier(0.22,0.61,0.36,1)] will-change-transform translate-y-0 opacity-100 lg:sticky lg:top-32 lg:mt-9" style="transition-delay: 140ms;"><div class="relative mx-auto max-w-[38rem] lg:ml-auto"><div class="relative"><div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute h-full w-full rounded-[3px] border border-gold/60 -top-4 -right-4"></div><img alt="Residential street with parked cars in the West Midlands" loading="lazy" class="img-graded relative aspect-[4/3] w-full rounded-[3px] object-cover shadow-panel" src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/39060777/pexels-photo-39060777.jpeg?auto=compress&amp;cs=tinysrgb&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=1200&amp;h=900"><div class="absolute bottom-5 left-5 flex max-w-[85%] items-center gap-2.5 rounded-[2px] px-4 py-3 shadow-panel bg-cream text-navy"><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold"></span><p class="text-[0.8rem] leading-snug font-medium">Residential and commercial property considered across the region</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id="landowners" aria-labelledby="landowners-heading" class="relative border-t border-gold/20 grain bg-navy-deep"><div class="relative mx-auto max-w-[88rem] px-5 py-24 sm:px-8 lg:px-12 lg:py-32"><div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-14"><div class="lg:col-span-6 lg:order-2"><div class="transition-all duration-[900ms] ease-[cubic-bezier(0.22,0.61,0.36,1)] will-change-transform translate-y-0 opacity-100" style="transition-delay: 0ms;"><p class="eyebrow flex items-center gap-3 text-gold-pale"><span aria-hidden="true" class="font-display text-[0.95rem] leading-none font-medium tracking-normal">04</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px w-10 bg-gold"></span>For Landowners</p><h2 id="landowners-heading" class="mt-5 max-w-xl font-display text-[2.6rem] leading-[1.04] font-medium sm:text-[3.4rem] text-cream">Explore your <em class="font-normal not-italic text-gold-pale">land's potential</em> — without funding the development</h2><p class="mt-6 max-w-md text-[1rem] leading-relaxed text-cream/75">You do not need to fund or manage a development to find out what your land could achieve. Through a development partnership with GS Property Group, we can assess your land, explore planning and design with appropriately qualified professionals, and — subject to agreed terms — you would not need to fund the development upfront or carry the development risk yourself.</p></div><div class="transition-all duration-[900ms] ease-[cubic-bezier(0.22,0.61,0.36,1)] will-change-transform translate-y-0 opacity-100" style="transition-delay: 120ms;"><ul class="mt-8 max-w-md space-y-3.5"><li class="flex gap-3.5"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-0.5 flex h-5.5 w-5.5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-gold/50 bg-navy text-gold-pale"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.25" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check h-3 w-3" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></span><span class="text-[0.95rem] leading-relaxed text-cream/78">Land with or without planning permission considered</span></li><li class="flex gap-3.5"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-0.5 flex h-5.5 w-5.5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-gold/50 bg-navy text-gold-pale"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.25" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check h-3 w-3" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></span><span class="text-[0.95rem] leading-relaxed text-cream/78">Development partnerships with no upfront development funding from you, subject to agreed terms</span></li><li class="flex gap-3.5"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-0.5 flex h-5.5 w-5.5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-gold/50 bg-navy text-gold-pale"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.25" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check h-3 w-3" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></span><span class="text-[0.95rem] leading-relaxed text-cream/78">Delivery through qualified professionals, including RICS, FMB and RIBA-affiliated partners</span></li><li class="flex gap-3.5"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-0.5 flex h-5.5 w-5.5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-gold/50 bg-navy text-gold-pale"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.25" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check h-3 w-3" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></span><span class="text-[0.95rem] leading-relaxed text-cream/78">A straightforward first assessment — just tell us where the land is</span></li></ul></div><div class="transition-all duration-[900ms] ease-[cubic-bezier(0.22,0.61,0.36,1)] will-change-transform translate-y-0 opacity-100" style="transition-delay: 200ms;"><div class="mt-10 flex flex-col gap-3.5 sm:flex-row"><a href="#enquire" class="group/btn inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2.5 rounded-[2px] px-7 py-3.5 text-[0.8125rem] font-semibold tracking-[0.12em] uppercase transition-all duration-300 ease-out bg-gold text-navy-deep hover:bg-gold-pale shadow-[0_10px_28px_-12px_rgba(182,154,104,0.65)]"><span>Discuss My Land</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 transition-transform duration-300 group-hover/btn:translate-x-1" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a><a href="#enquire" class="group/btn inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2.5 rounded-[2px] px-7 py-3.5 text-[0.8125rem] font-semibold tracking-[0.12em] uppercase transition-all duration-300 ease-out border border-cream/45 text-cream hover:border-cream hover:bg-cream/10 backdrop-blur-[2px]"><span>Explore Development Partnerships</span></a></div></div></div><div class="lg:col-span-6 lg:order-1"><div class="transition-all duration-[900ms] ease-[cubic-bezier(0.22,0.61,0.36,1)] will-change-transform translate-y-0 opacity-100 lg:sticky lg:top-32 lg:mt-9" style="transition-delay: 140ms;"><div class="relative mx-auto max-w-[38rem] lg:mr-auto"><div class="relative"><div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute h-full w-full rounded-[3px] border border-gold/60 -top-4 -left-4"></div><img alt="Aerial view of a housing development surrounded by greenery" loading="lazy" class="img-graded relative aspect-[4/3] w-full rounded-[3px] object-cover shadow-panel" src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/1642125/pexels-photo-1642125.jpeg?auto=compress&amp;cs=tinysrgb&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=1200&amp;h=900"><div class="absolute bottom-5 left-5 flex max-w-[85%] items-center gap-2.5 rounded-[2px] px-4 py-3 shadow-panel bg-navy text-cream"><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold"></span><p class="text-[0.8rem] leading-snug font-medium">Land with or without planning permission considered</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id="about" aria-labelledby="about-heading" class="bg-[#fbfaf7]"><div class="mx-auto max-w-[88rem] px-5 py-24 sm:px-8 lg:px-12 lg:py-32"><div class="grid gap-16 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-12"><div class="lg:col-span-6 xl:col-span-6"><div class="transition-all duration-[900ms] ease-[cubic-bezier(0.22,0.61,0.36,1)] will-change-transform translate-y-0 opacity-100" style="transition-delay: 0ms;"><p class="eyebrow flex items-center gap-3 text-gold-deep"><span aria-hidden="true" class="font-display text-[0.95rem] leading-none font-medium tracking-normal">02</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px w-10 bg-gold"></span>Why GS Property Group</p><h2 id="about-heading" class="mt-5 font-display text-[2.6rem] leading-[1.04] font-medium text-navy sm:text-[3.4rem]">Local Knowledge. Personal Service. <em class="font-normal not-italic text-gold-deep">Clear Communication.</em></h2></div><div class="transition-all duration-[900ms] ease-[cubic-bezier(0.22,0.61,0.36,1)] will-change-transform translate-y-0 opacity-100" style="transition-delay: 110ms;"><div class="mt-8 space-y-5 text-[1rem] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft"><p>GS Property Group is a family-run business, three generations in, driven by personalised service, honest communication and transparency. The West Midlands has been our home for over 45 years — we are deliberately local, because understanding this market street by street is what makes our advice worth hearing.</p><p>We work with property investors, landlords, homeowners, commercial owners and landowners across Birmingham and the surrounding towns, specialising in property sourcing, refurbishment projects and property management. Whether you are exploring an investment or looking for a way forward with a property of your own, you will deal directly with people who know the area and will explain your options plainly.</p><p>We operate an open-book policy with everyone we work with, treating all parties fairly and equally — and we follow the codes of conduct of the professional bodies listed below.</p></div></div><div class="transition-all duration-[900ms] ease-[cubic-bezier(0.22,0.61,0.36,1)] will-change-transform translate-y-0 opacity-100" style="transition-delay: 180ms;"><h3 class="eyebrow mt-12 text-navy/60">Our Core Principles</h3><ol class="mt-5 divide-y divide-stone-line border-y border-stone-line"><li class="group flex gap-6 py-5"><span aria-hidden="true" class="font-display text-lg font-medium text-gold-deep">01</span><div><h4 class="font-display text-[1.35rem] font-medium text-navy">Location</h4><p class="mt-1 text-[0.925rem] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">Three generations of local knowledge guide where we look — and where we don't.</p></div></li><li class="group flex gap-6 py-5"><span aria-hidden="true" class="font-display text-lg font-medium text-gold-deep">02</span><div><h4 class="font-display text-[1.35rem] font-medium text-navy">Property</h4><p class="mt-1 text-[0.925rem] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">Each property is judged on its own merits, condition and realistic potential.</p></div></li><li class="group flex gap-6 py-5"><span aria-hidden="true" class="font-display text-lg font-medium text-gold-deep">03</span><div><h4 class="font-display text-[1.35rem] font-medium text-navy">Tenant &amp; Covenant</h4><p class="mt-1 text-[0.925rem] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">For income-producing property, the strength of the tenancy matters as much as the bricks.</p></div></li></ol></div><div class="transition-all duration-[900ms] ease-[cubic-bezier(0.22,0.61,0.36,1)] will-change-transform translate-y-0 opacity-100" style="transition-delay: 240ms;"><div class="mt-10"><a href="#enquire" class="group/link relative inline-flex items-center gap-2 pb-1 text-[0.8125rem] font-semibold tracking-[0.12em] uppercase text-navy"><span>Discuss Your Property Goals</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 text-gold-deep transition-transform duration-300 group-hover/link:translate-x-1" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 h-px w-full origin-left scale-x-100 transition-transform duration-500 ease-out group-hover/link:scale-x-0 bg-navy/25"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 h-px w-full origin-right scale-x-0 bg-gold transition-transform duration-500 ease-out group-hover/link:scale-x-100"></span></a></div></div></div><div class="lg:col-span-6"><div class="transition-all duration-[900ms] ease-[cubic-bezier(0.22,0.61,0.36,1)] will-change-transform translate-y-0 opacity-100 lg:sticky lg:top-28" style="transition-delay: 140ms;"><div class="relative mx-auto max-w-[38rem] lg:ml-auto"><div class="relative"><div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute -top-4 -right-4 h-full w-full rounded-[3px] border border-gold/60"></div><img alt="Narrowboat moored on a calm city canal between brick buildings" loading="lazy" class="img-graded relative aspect-[4/3] w-full rounded-[3px] object-cover shadow-panel" src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/7244476/pexels-p