="rounded-full border border-stone-line bg-cream px-3.5 py-1.5 text-[0.8rem] font-medium text-navy">Refurbishment projects</li><li class="rounded-full border border-stone-line bg-cream px-3.5 py-1.5 text-[0.8rem] font-medium text-navy">New property development</li><li class="rounded-full border border-stone-line bg-cream px-3.5 py-1.5 text-[0.8rem] font-medium text-navy">Development land</li></ul></div></div></div></div></div><div class="transition-all duration-[900ms] ease-[cubic-bezier(0.22,0.61,0.36,1)] will-change-transform translate-y-0 opacity-100" style="transition-delay: 120ms;"><div class="mt-20 border-y border-stone-line py-10 lg:mt-24"><div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-7 text-center"><p class="eyebrow text-navy/55">Licensed, Authorised &amp; Members Of</p><ul class="flex max-w-5xl flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-x-10 gap-y-4"><li class="font-display text-[1.15rem] font-normal text-navy/75 sm:text-[1.25rem]">The Property Ombudsman</li><li class="font-display text-[1.15rem] font-normal text-navy/75 sm:text-[1.25rem]">Trading Standards Approved Code</li><li class="font-display text-[1.15rem] font-normal text-navy/75 sm:text-[1.25rem]">Information Commissioner's Office</li><li class="font-display text-[1.15rem] font-normal text-navy/75 sm:text-[1.25rem]">Deposit Protection Scheme</li><li class="font-display text-[1.15rem] font-normal text-navy/75 sm:text-[1.25rem]">Residential Landlords Association</li></ul><p class="max-w-2xl text-[0.85rem] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">We follow the codes of conduct of these organisations. For new developments, our contractors and professional partners are members of bodies including RICS, the Federation of Master Builders and RIBA, and work to local authority planning and building policies.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section id="process" aria-labelledby="process-heading" class="grain relative overflow-hidden border-t border-gold/20 bg-navy"><span aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute -top-10 right-4 font-display text-[16rem] leading-none font-light text-cream/[0.04] select-none lg:text-[22rem]">GS</span><div class="relative mx-auto max-w-[88rem] px-5 py-24 sm:px-8 lg:px-12 lg:py-32"><div class="flex flex-col gap-8 lg:flex-row lg:items-end lg:justify-between"><div class="transition-all duration-[900ms] ease-[cubic-bezier(0.22,0.61,0.36,1)] will-change-transform translate-y-0 opacity-100" style="transition-delay: 0ms;"><p class="eyebrow flex items-center gap-3 text-gold-pale"><span aria-hidden="true" class="font-display text-[0.95rem] leading-none font-medium tracking-normal">03</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px w-10 bg-gold"></span>How It Works</p><h2 id="process-heading" class="mt-5 font-display text-[2.6rem] leading-[1.04] font-medium text-cream sm:text-[3.4rem]">A Clearer Way <em class="font-normal not-italic text-gold-pale">Forward.</em></h2></div><div class="transition-all duration-[900ms] ease-[cubic-bezier(0.22,0.61,0.36,1)] will-change-transform translate-y-0 opacity-100" style="transition-delay: 120ms;"><p class="max-w-md text-[1rem] leading-relaxed text-cream/70 lg:pb-2">No pressure, no obligation — just a straightforward process that puts you in control at every stage.</p></div></div><ol class="relative mt-16 grid gap-12 md:grid-cols-3 md:gap-8 lg:gap-12"><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute top-7 right-[16%] left-[16%] hidden h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-gold/0 via-gold/45 to-gold/0 md:block"></span><li><div class="transition-all duration-[900ms] ease-[cubic-bezier(0.22,0.61,0.36,1)] will-change-transform translate-y-0 opacity-100" style="transition-delay: 0ms;"><div class="relative"><span class="relative z-10 flex h-14 w-14 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-gold/50 bg-navy font-display text-lg font-medium text-gold-pale">01</span><h3 class="mt-7 font-display text-[1.7rem] leading-tight font-medium text-cream">Start a Conversation</h3><p class="mt-3.5 max-w-sm text-[0.95rem] leading-relaxed text-cream/70">Tell us about your property, investment goals, or development plans — in your own words, with as much or as little detail as you're comfortable sharing.</p></div></div></li><li><div class="transition-all duration-[900ms] ease-[cubic-bezier(0.22,0.61,0.36,1)] will-change-transform translate-y-0 opacity-100" style="transition-delay: 140ms;"><div class="relative"><span class="relative z-10 flex h-14 w-14 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-gold/50 bg-navy font-display text-lg font-medium text-gold-pale">02</span><h3 class="mt-7 font-display text-[1.7rem] leading-tight font-medium text-cream">Explore Your Options</h3><p class="mt-3.5 max-w-sm text-[0.95rem] leading-relaxed text-cream/70">We discuss your circumstances and consider the possible routes available, explaining the practicalities of each so you can judge what suits you.</p></div></div></li><li><div class="transition-all duration-[900ms] ease-[cubic-bezier(0.22,0.61,0.36,1)] will-change-transform translate-y-0 opacity-100" style="transition-delay: 280ms;"><div class="relative"><span class="relative z-10 flex h-14 w-14 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-gold/50 bg-navy font-display text-lg font-medium text-gold-pale">03</span><h3 class="mt-7 font-display text-[1.7rem] leading-tight font-medium text-cream">Agree on the Next Steps</h3><p class="mt-3.5 max-w-sm text-[0.95rem] leading-relaxed text-cream/70">If there is a suitable opportunity, we explain the proposed approach and next steps clearly — before anything is agreed or signed.</p></div></div></li></ol><div class="transition-all duration-[900ms] ease-[cubic-bezier(0.22,0.61,0.36,1)] will-change-transform translate-y-0 opacity-100" style="transition-delay: 200ms;"><div class="mt-16 flex flex-col gap-6 border-t border-cream/12 pt-9 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between"><p class="flex max-w-xl items-start gap-3 text-[0.9rem] leading-relaxed text-cream/65"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width=