"></span>Make an Enquiry</p><h2 id="enquiry-heading" class="mt-5 font-display text-[2.6rem] leading-[1.04] font-medium text-navy sm:text-[3.4rem]">Let's Talk About Your <em class="font-normal not-italic text-gold-deep">Property Goals.</em></h2><p class="mt-6 max-w-md text-[1rem] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">Whether you're exploring an investment, reviewing your rental portfolio, considering a property sale, or assessing the potential of your land, start with a conversation. Choose the option that fits you and we'll take it from there.</p><ul class="mt-8 space-y-3.5 text-[0.925rem] text-ink-soft"><li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-[7px] h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rotate-45 bg-gold-deep"></span>A personal response from our Birmingham-based team</li><li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-[7px] h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rotate-45 bg-gold-deep"></span>No obligation — an enquiry is not a commitment</li><li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-[7px] h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rotate-45 bg-gold-deep"></span>Your details are used only to respond to your enquiry</li></ul><div class="mt-10 space-y-4 border-t border-stone-line pt-8"><p class="eyebrow text-navy/55">Prefer to Reach Us Directly?</p><div class="space-y-3 text-[0.95rem]"><a href="tel:+441217141658" class="flex items-center gap-3 font-medium text-navy transition-colors hover:text-gold-deep"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-phone h-4.5 w-4.5 text-gold-deep" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M13.832 16.568a1 1 0 0 0 1.213-.303l.355-.465A2 2 0 0 1 17 15h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v3a2 2 0 0 1-2 2A18 18 0 0 1 2 4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v3a2 2 0 0 1-.8 1.6l-.468.351a1 1 0 0 0-.292 1.233 14 14 0 0 0 6.392 6.384"></path></svg>0121 714 1658</a><a href="mailto:info@gspropertygroup.co.uk" cl