ent and upcoming projects.</p><p class="mt-1.5 text-[0.85rem] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">Whether you're considering active involvement or a more hands-off partnership, we'll explain how we work and answer your questions.</p></div><div class="mt-8 grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2"><div><label for="field-fullName" class="mb-2 block text-[0.8125rem] font-semibold tracking-wide text-navy">Full name</label><input id="field-fullName" autocomplete="name" aria-invalid="false" class="w-full rounded-[2px] border bg-cream/40 px-4 py-3 text-[0.95rem] text-charcoal placeholder:text-ink-soft/45 transition-colors duration-300 border-stone-line hover:border-navy/35 focus:border-gold-deep focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-gold/25" placeholder="Your name" type="text" value=""></div><div><label for="field-phone" class="mb-2 block text-[0.8125rem] font-semibold tracking-wide text-navy">Telephone</label><input id="field-phone" autocomplete="tel" aria-invalid="false" class="w-full rounded-[2px] border bg-cream/40 px-4 py-3 text-[0.95rem] text-charcoal placeholder:text-ink-soft/45 transition-colors duration-300 border-stone-line hover:border-navy/35 focus:border-gold-deep focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-gold/25" placeholder="07… or 0121…" type="tel" value=""></div><div class="sm:col-span-2"><div><label for="field-email" class="mb-2 block text-[0.8125rem] font-semibold tracking-wide text-navy">Email address</label><input id="field-email" autocomplete="email" aria-invalid="false" class="w-full rounded-[2px] border bg-cream/40 px-4 py-3 text-[0.95rem] text-charcoal placeholder:text-ink-soft/45 transition-colors duration-300 border-stone-line hover:border-navy/35 focus:border-gold-deep focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-gold/25" placeholder="name@example.co.uk" type="email" value=""></div></div><div class=""><div><label for="field-investmentInterests" class="mb-2 block text-[0.8125rem] font-semibold tracking-wide text-navy">Investment interests</label><div class="relative"><select id="field-investmentInterests" aria-invalid="false" class="w-full rounded-[2px] border bg-cream/40 px-4 py-3 text-[0.95rem] placeholder:text-ink-soft/45 transition-colors duration-300 border-stone-line hover:border-navy/35 focus:border-gold-deep focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-gold/25 appearance-none pr-11 text-ink-soft/60"><option value="">Please select…</option><option value="Development projects">Development projects</option><option value="Joint venture opportunities">Joint venture opportunities</option><option value="Refurbishment projects">Refurbishment projects</option><option value="Conversions (HMO / apartments)">Conversions (HMO / apartments)</option><option value="I'm not sure yet — advise me">I'm not sure yet — advise me</option></select><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down pointer-events-none absolute top-1/2 right-3.5 h-4.5 w-4.5 -translate-y-1/2 text-ink-soft" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></div></div></div><div class=""><div><label for="field-investmentBudget" class="mb-2 block text-[0.8125rem] font-semibold tracking-wide text-navy">Indicative investment budget<span class="ml-1.5 font-normal text-ink-soft/70">(optional)</span></label><div class="relative"><select id="field-investmentBudget" aria-invalid="false" aria-describedby="field-investmentBudget-hint" class="w-full rounded-[2px] border bg-cream/40 px-4 py-3 text-[0.95rem] placeholder:text-ink-soft/45 transition-colors duration-300 border-stone-line hover:border-navy/35 focus:border-gold-deep focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-gold/25 appearance-none pr-11 text-ink-soft/60"><option value="">Please select…</option><option value="Under £50,000">Under £50,000</option><option value="£50,000 – £100,000">£50,000 – £100,000</option><option value="£100,000 – £250,000">£100,000 – £250,000</option><option value="£250,000 – £500,000">£250,000 – £500,000</option><option value="Over £500,000">Over £500,000</option><option value="I'd prefer to discuss">I'd prefer to discuss</option></select><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down pointer-events-none absolute top-1/2 right-3.5 h-4.5 w-4.5 -translate-y-1/2 text-ink-soft" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></div><p id="field-investmentBudget-hint" class="mt-1.5 text-[0.78rem] text-ink-soft/80">Optional — simply helps us discuss relevant projects.</p></div></div><div class="sm:col-span-2"><div><label for="field-message" class="mb-2 block text-[0.8125rem] font-semibold tracking-wide text-navy">Your message<span class="ml-1.5 font-normal text-ink-soft/70">(optional)</span></label><textarea id="field-message" rows="4" class="w-full rounded-[2px] border bg-cream/40 px-4 py-3 text-[0.95rem] text-charcoal placeholder:text-ink-soft/45 transition-colors duration-300 border-stone-line hover:border-navy/35 focus:border-gold-deep focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-gold/25 resize-y" placeholder="Tell us a little about your experience, the type of projects that interest you, and how involved you'd like to be…"></textarea></div></div></div><div class="mt-8 flex flex-col gap-5"><button type="submit" class="group inline-flex w-full items-center justify-center gap-2.5 rounded-[2px] bg-navy px-7 py-4 text-[0.8125rem] font-semibold tracking-[0.08em] text-cream uppercase transition-all duration-300 hover:bg-navy-soft disabled:cursor-wait disabled:opacity-80 sm:w-auto sm:self-start sm:px-10">Send My Enquiry<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></button><p class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[0.78rem] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft/85"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-lock mt-0.5 h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="18" height="11" x="3" y="11" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"></path></svg><span>By submitting, you agree to be contacted about your enquiry. We never sell your details. Read our <a href="https://gspropertygroup.co.uk/privacy-policy" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="font-medium text-navy underline decoration-gold decoration-2 underline-offset-2 hover:text-gold-deep">Privacy Policy</a>. This preview form is a design demonstration and does not send enquiries.</span></p></div></div></form></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id="faq" aria-labelledby="faq-heading" class="bg-[#fbfaf7]"><div class="mx-auto max-w-[88rem] px-5 py-24 sm:px-8 lg:px-12 lg:py-32"><div class="grid gap-14 lg:grid-cols-12"><div class="lg:col-span-4"><div class="transition-all duration-[900ms] ease-[cubic-bezier(0.22,0.61,0.36,1)] will-change-transform translate-y-0 opacity-100" style="transition-delay: 0ms;"><div class="lg:sticky lg:top-28"><p class="eyebrow flex items-center gap-3 text-gold-deep"><span aria-hidden="true" class="font-display text-[0.95rem] leading-none font-medium tracking-normal">05</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px w-10 bg-gold"></span>Common Questions</p><h2 id="faq-heading" class="mt-5 font-display text-[2.6rem] leading-[1.04] font-medium text-navy sm:text-[3.1rem]">Answers, Before <em class="font-normal not-italic text-gold-deep">You Ask.</em></h2><p class="mt-6 max-w-sm text-[1rem] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">The questions investors, landlords, sellers and landowners ask us most — answered plainly. Anything else, we're happy to talk it through.</p><div class="mt-9 rounded-[3px] border border-stone-line border-t-2 border-t-gold bg-cream p-6"><p class="font-display text-[1.4rem] font-normal text-navy">Still have a question?</p><p class="mt-2 text-[0.9rem] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">Call us for an informal conversation — no obligation, and no sales script.</p><a href="tel:+441217141658" class="mt-4 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-[0.9rem] font-semibold text-navy underline decoration-gold decoration-2 underline-offset-4 transition-colors hover:text-gold-deep"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-phone h-4 w-4 text-gold-deep" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M13.832 16.568a1 1 0 0 0 1.213-.303l.355-.465A2 2 0 0 1 17 15h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v3a2 2 0 0 1-2 2A18 18 0 0 1 2 4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v3a2 2 0 0 1-.8 1.6l-.468.351a1 1 0 0 0-.292 1.233 14 14 0 0 0 6.392 6.384"></path></svg>0121 714 1658</a></div></div></div></div><div class="lg:col-span-8"><div class="transition-all duration-[900ms] ease-[cubic-bezier(0.22,0.61,0.36,1)] will-change-transform translate-y-0 opacity-100" style="transition-delay: 120ms;"><div class="border-t border-stone-line"><div class="border-b border-stone-line"><h3><button type="button" id="faq-button-0" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="faq-panel-0" class="group flex w-full items-center gap-5 py-6 text-left"><span aria-hidden="true" class="hidden font-display text-base text-gold-deep sm:block">01</span><span class="flex-1 font-display text-[1.3rem] leading-snug font-medium transition-colors duration-300 sm:text-[1.4rem] text-navy">What types of property projects does GS Property Group work with?</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border transition-all duration-500 rotate-45 border-gold bg-gold text-navy-deep"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus h-4 w-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span></button></h3><div id="faq-panel-0" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-button-0" class="faq-answer" data-open="true"><div><p class="max-w-2xl pr-4 pb-7 text-[0.95rem] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft sm:pl-10">Our work spans commercial units, commercial-to-residential refurbishment projects, conversions to HMOs and apartments, and the development of new property. We specialise in property sourcing, refurbishment and property management across Birmingham and the West Midlands, and every project is assessed against our core principles of location, the property itself, and tenant or covenant strength.</p></div></div></div><div class="border-b border-stone-line"><h3><button type="button" id="faq-button-1" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-panel-1" class="group flex w-full items-center gap-5 py-6 text-left"><span aria-hidden="true" class="hidden font-display text-base text-gold-deep sm:block">02</span><span class="flex-1 font-display text-[1.3rem] leading-snug font-medium transition-colors duration-300 sm:text-[1.4rem] text-charcoal group-hover:text-navy">How can I explore a property investment or joint venture?</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border transition-all duration-500 border-stone-line text-navy group-hover:border-gold"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus h-4 w-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span></button></h3><div id="faq-panel-1" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-button-1" class="faq-answer" data-open="false"><div><p class="max-w-2xl pr-4 pb-7 text-[0.95rem] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft sm:pl-10">Start with a conversation. We work with local, national and international investors, as well as funds and lenders interested in joint venture opportunities — whether as an active or a more passive partner. Share your investment interests and, if you wish, an indicative budget through our enquiry form, and we'll explain how our partnerships work and discuss whether any current projects may be suitable. Returns are never guaranteed, and we'll always be open about the risks involved.</p></div></div></div><div class="border-b border-stone-line"><h3><button type="button" id="faq-button-2" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-panel-2" class="group flex w-full items-center gap-5 py-6 text-left"><span aria-hidden="true" class="hidden font-display text-base text-gold-deep sm:block">03</span><span class="flex-1 font-display text-[1.3rem] leading-snug font-medium transition-colors duration-300 sm:text-[1.4rem] text-charcoal group-hover:text-navy">Can you help landlords who want to sell their rental properties?</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border transition-all duration-500 border-stone-line text-navy group-hover:border-gold"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus h-4 w-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span></button></h3><div id="faq-panel-2" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-button-2" class="faq-answer" data-open="false"><div><p class="max-w-2xl pr-4 pb-7 text-[0.95rem] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft sm:pl-10">Yes. If you've reached the point where managing rental property no longer suits you — whether because of changing legislation, retirement plans, or simply wanting your time back — we can discuss purchasing your property or portfolio directly, including properties with tenants in place. We can also talk through property management if you'd prefer to keep ownership. The right route depends on your circumstances, which is why we always start with a discussion.</p></div></div></div><div class="border-b border-stone-line"><h3><button type="button" id="faq-button-3" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-panel-3" class="group flex w-full items-center gap-5 py-6 text-left"><span aria-hidden="true" class="hidden font-display text-base text-gold-deep sm:block">04</span><span class="flex-1 font-display text-[1.3rem] leading-snug font-medium transition-colors duration-300 sm:text-[1.4rem] text-charcoal group-hover:text-navy">Can I discuss selling a property that needs refurbishment?</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border transition-all duration-500 border-stone-line text-navy group-hover:border-gold"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus h-4 w-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span></button></h3><div id="faq-panel-3" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-button-3" class="faq-answer" data-open="false"><div><p class="max-w-2xl pr-4 pb-7 text-[0.95rem] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft sm:pl-10">Absolutely. Refurbishment is one of our core specialisms, so a property that needs work is not a barrier to a conversation. We consider residential and commercial property across Birmingham and the West Midlands, and because you would be dealing with us directly, there are no estate agency chains to manage. Tell us about the property and your timescale, and we'll explain the options clearly.</p></div></div></div><div class="border-b border-stone-line"><h3><button type="button" id="faq-button-4" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-panel-4" class="group flex w-full items-center gap-5 py-6 text-left"><span aria-hidden="true" class="hidden font-display text-base text-gold-deep sm:block">05</span><span class="flex-1 font-display text-[1.3rem] leading-snug font-medium transition-colors duration-300 sm:text-[1.4rem] text-charcoal group-hover:text-navy">Can landowners explore development partnerships without funding the development themselves?</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border transition-all duration-500 border-stone-line text-navy group-hover:border-gold"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus h-4 w-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span></button></h3><div id="faq-panel-4" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-button-4" class="faq-answer" data-open="false"><div><p class="max-w-2xl pr-4 pb-7 text-[0.95rem] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft sm:pl-10">In many cases, yes. A development partnership can allow you to explore your land's potential without funding or managing the development personally, subject to the site's suitability and agreed terms. We consider development land with or without planning permission. Share the location and approximate size of your land and we'll give you an honest view of whether it may have potential.</p></div></div></div><div class="border-b border-stone-line"><h3><button type="button" id="faq-button-5" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-panel-5" class="group flex w-full items-center gap-5 py-6 text-left"><span aria-hidden="true" class="hidden font-display text-base text-gold-deep sm:block">06</span><span class="flex-1 font-display text-[1.3rem] leading-snug font-medium transition-colors duration-300 sm:text-[1.4rem] text-charcoal group-hover:text-navy">What information should I provide when making an enquiry?</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border transition-all duration-500 border-stone-line text-navy group-hover:border-gold"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus h-4 w-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span></button></h3><div id="faq-panel-5" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-button-5" class="faq-answer" data-open="false"><div><p class="max-w-2xl pr-4 pb-7 text-[0.95rem] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft sm:pl-10">Just the essentials: your contact details and a brief outline of your situation. Investors may find it helpful to mention their interests and an indicative budget; landlords, the location and number of properties; sellers, the property type and preferred timescale; landowners, the land's location, approximate size and planning status if known. The more relevant detail you share, the more useful our first conversation can be — but nothing beyond the basics is required.</p></div></div></div><div class="border-b border-stone-line"><h3><button type="button" id="faq-button-6" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-panel-6" class="group flex w-full items-center gap-5 py-6 text-left"><span aria-hidden="true" class="hidden font-display text-base text-gold-deep sm:block">07</span><span class="flex-1 font-display text-[1.3rem] leading-snug font-medium transition-colors duration-300 sm:text-[1.4rem] text-charcoal group-hover:text-navy">Am I committing to anything by contacting GS Property Group?</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border transition-all duration-500 border-stone-line text-navy group-hover:border-gold"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus h-4 w-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span></button></h3><div id="faq-panel-6" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-button-6" class="faq-answer" data-open="false"><div><p class="max-w-2xl pr-4 pb-7 text-[0.95rem] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft sm:pl-10">No. An enquiry simply starts a conversation. We'll discuss your circumstances, explain the routes that may be available, and set out any proposed next steps clearly. Whether you proceed is entirely your decision, and submitting an enquiry does not guarantee an offer or a particular outcome — that always depends on the property, the project and terms we can agree together.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section aria-labelledby="final-cta-heading" class="relative overflow-hidden bg-navy-deep"><div class="absolute inset-0" aria-hidden="true"><img alt="" loading="lazy" class="img-graded h-full w-full object-cover" src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/29579462/pexels-photo-29579462.jpeg?auto=compress&amp;cs=tinysrgb&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=2000&amp;h=1150"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-navy-deep/72"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-navy-deep/85 via-transparent to-navy-deep/55"></div></div><div class="relative mx-auto max-w-[88rem] px-5 py-24 text-center sm:px-8 lg:px-12 lg:py-36"><div class="transition-all duration-[900ms] ease-[cubic-bezier(0.22,0.61,0.36,1)] will-change-transform translate-y-0 opacity-100" style="transition-delay: 0ms;"><p class="eyebrow inline-flex items-center gap-3 text-gold-pale"><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px w-10 bg-gold"></span>Birmingham &amp; the West Midlands<span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px w-10 bg-gold"></span></p><h2 id="final-cta-heading" class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-3xl font-display text-[2.6rem] leading-[1.06] font-medium text-cream sm:text-[3.4rem] lg:text-[3.9rem]">Your Next Property Decision Starts With a <em class="font-normal not-italic text-gold-pale">Conversation.</em></h2><p class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-xl text-[1rem] leading-relaxed text-cream/78 sm:text-lg">Tell us what you're looking to achieve. We'll discuss your circumstances and explore whether GS Property Group can help.</p><div class="mt-10 flex flex-col justify-center gap-3.5 sm:flex-row"><a href="#enquire" class="group/btn inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2.5 rounded-[2px] px-7 py-3.5 text-[0.8125rem] font-semibold tracking-[0.12em] uppercase transition-all duration-300 ease-out bg-gold text-navy-deep hover:bg-gold-pale shadow-[0_10px_28px_-12px_rgba(182,154,104,0.65)]"><span>Start a Conversation</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 transition-transform duration-300 group-hover/btn:translate-x-1" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a><a href="#pathways" class="group/btn inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2.5 rounded-[2px] px-7 py-3.5 text-[0.8125rem] font-semibold tracking-[0.12em] uppercase transition-all duration-300 ease-out border border-cream/45 text-cream hover:border-cream hover:bg-cream/10 backdrop-blur-[2px]"><span>Explore Our Services</span></a></div></div></div></section></main><footer class="grain relative overflow-hidden border-t border-gold/20 bg-navy-deep"><div class="relative mx-auto max-w-[88rem] px-5 pt-16 pb-10 sm:px-8 lg:px-12 lg:pt-20"><div class="grid gap-12 pb-12 lg:grid-cols-12"><div class="lg:col-span-5"><span class="site-logo inline-flex" aria-label="GS Property Group"><img alt="" width="249" hei